'' 'defined' semantics, all three verified against fbc:
''   - its operand is NOT parameter-substituted inside a macro body, so M( YES )
''     reports NOT defined even though YES is a macro
''   - it is true for KEYWORDS, not just macros
''   - it is false for an unknown identifier
'' The corpus test pp/defined-udt.bas compiles under fbc only because of the first.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-tokens=pp tests/pp/src/defined.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: FBX0308
'' GOLDEN: expected/defined.out
